LOCAL INSTALLATION
------------------

This version of the package installs Microsoft TrueType core fonts from a 
local directory provided during the package build (msfonts/). These fonts 
are sourced from a modern Windows 11 installation, providing a more 
comprehensive and updated set than the original web core fonts.

The fonts are stored in /usr/share/msttcorefonts and are symbolically 
linked to /usr/share/fonts/truetype/msttcorefonts upon acceptance of the 
Microsoft EULA.

LIBERATION FONTS
----------------

The package fonts-liberation contains free variants of the Times,
Arial and Courier fonts. We recommend to use that instead unless you
specifically need one of the other fonts from this package.

